      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I asked for 3 quotations. All three replied with quotes, after looking at photos or our roof. 2 or the 3 visited the house,, and one spent some time on the roof, assessing the problems with shading - from trees and tall chimneys.Prices were similar from all three, and all supplied details of their systems, which were very helpful in comparing them.I finally chose the most expensive of the three, after being convinced that it would perform best with our shading problems. One of the other companies asked for reasons why I had not chosen them, which led to some discussion between him, me and the successful tenderer. This was also helpful.The followup from the successful tenderer was very good.We decided not to get a battery at this stage, but to get a system that would allow for a battery to be installed at a later date with minimum difficulty or expense in the installation.",
